<!doctype html><html><head><title>Dental Clarity Summary</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://maxcdn.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/3.3.7/css/bootstrap.min.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"></head><body><div class="container"><p><a href="/profile">Back to dashboard</a></p><h1>Dental Visit Summary</h1><div class="well"><h3><%= patient.name %></h3><p>Email: <%= patient.email %></p><p>Diagnosis: <strong><%= patient.diagnosis %></strong></p><p>Preferred language: <%= patient.language %></p><h3>What does this mean?</h3><p><%= explanation %></p><h3>Possible treatment</h3><p><%= treatment %></p><h3>Aftercare</h3><p>Follow the instructions given by your dental professional. Brush gently twice a day and clean between your teeth daily unless your clinician advises otherwise.</p></div><h3>Update patient</h3><form action="/patients/<%= patient._id %>/update" method="POST"><div class="form-group"><label>Language</label><select name="language" class="form-control"><option <%= patient.language === 'English' ? 'selected' : '' %>>English</option><option <%= patient.language === 'Spanish' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Spanish</option></select></div><div class="form-group"><label>Diagnosis</label><select name="diagnosis" class="form-control"><option <%= patient.diagnosis === 'Gingivitis' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Gingivitis</option><option <%= patient.diagnosis === 'Periodontal disease' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Periodontal disease</option><option <%= patient.diagnosis === 'Dental caries' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Dental caries</option></select></div><button class="btn btn-primary">Update</button></form><hr><h3>Visual education</h3><p>Compare healthy gums and gums affected by periodontal disease.</p><h3>Email</h3><p>Summary sent to the patient after clinician review. Email sending is not connected yet.</p><p class="small"></p></div></body></html>